@host = http://localhost:5174

### Ingest the latest 100 AAPL days from Alpha Vantage (compact feed)
POST {{host}}/api/stocks/ingest

### Ingest only the latest 25 days
POST {{host}}/api/stocks/ingest?count=25

### Ingest the full ~6,500-day history (Alpha Vantage full feed)
POST {{host}}/api/stocks/ingest?count=100000

### Get stored data (paged, newest first)
GET {{host}}/api/stocks?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=priceDate&sortDirection=desc
Accept: application/json

### Search / filter / sort example
GET {{host}}/api/stocks?page=1&pageSize=20&search=2026-08&sortBy=close&sortDirection=desc
Accept: application/json

### Latest stored record
GET {{host}}/api/stocks/latest
Accept: application/json

### Record for a specific day (optional endpoint)
GET {{host}}/api/stocks/2026-08-18
Accept: application/json
